        "### Experiment 3: Probability Distributions and Bayes’ Theorem\n",
        "\n",
        "**Problem Statement:**\n",
        "* **Disease Prevalence ($P(D)$):** $1\\% = 0.01$\n",
        "* **Test Sensitivity ($P(T^+ | D)$):** $95\\% = 0.95$\n",
        "* **Test Specificity ($P(T^- | D^c)$):** $90\\% = 0.90$\n",
        "* **False Positive Rate ($P(T^+ | D^c)$):** $1 - \\text{Specificity} = 10\\% = 0.10$\n",
        "\n",
        "We need to find the posterior probability that a patient actually has the disease given a positive test result: $P(D | T^+)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "0ca55bdc",
        "outputId": "7230acb4-d48f-497f-a6dc-d51bf63199c4"
      },
      "source": [
        "import numpy as np\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "\n",
        "# Given parameters\n",
        "prior_disease = 0.01  # Prevalence\n",
        "sensitivity = 0.95    # True Positive Rate\n",
        "specificity = 0.90    # True Negative Rate\n",
        "\n",
        "# Calculations\n",
        "prior_no_disease = 1 - prior_disease\n",
        "false_positive_rate = 1 - specificity\n",
        "\n",
        "# Bayes' Theorem formulation\n",
        "# P(T+) = P(T+|D)*P(D) + P(T+|D_c)*P(D_c)\n",
        "total_positive_probability = (sensitivity * prior_disease) + (false_positive_rate * prior_no_disease)\n",
        "\n",
        "# P(D|T+) = (P(T+|D)*P(D)) / P(T+)\n",
        "posterior_disease_given_positive = (sensitivity * prior_disease) / total_positive_probability\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Prior Probability of Disease (Prevalence): {prior_disease:.2%}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Test Sensitivity: {sensitivity:.2%}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Test Specificity: {specificity:.2%}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Probability of a Positive Test Result: {total_positive_probability:.2%}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Posterior Probability P(Disease | Positive Test): {posterior_disease_given_positive:.2%}\")"
      ],
